{"seq":1,"slug":"failed-delivery-reattempt","title":"派送失败再投策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-lastmile-delivery-network/delivery-fail-retry/failed-delivery-reattempt","wordCount":2023,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"派送失败再投策略\">派送失败再投策略</h1><p>派送失败是尾程的常态。在住宅派送占主导的市场里，首次投递遇不到人是完全可以预期的结果——收件人在上班、在出差、没听见门铃、或者根本不知道有包裹要来。把这件事当成异常分支去处理（记一条日志、发一封邮件），是尾程系统里最典型的设计错误，因为剩下那两成订单的处理成本往往超过前八成。这一篇建立再投的代价模型，并给出按场景选择策略的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-失败原因的分类学\">核心概念：失败原因的分类学</h2><p>再投策略的第一步不是决定&quot;怎么再投&quot;，而是搞清楚<strong>为什么失败</strong>。不同原因对应完全不同的最优处理，笼统地&quot;再投一次&quot;是低效的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"失败原因分类表\">失败原因分类表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败原因</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>本质问题</th>\n<th>最优处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无人签收</td>\n<td>&quot;收件人不在&quot;</td>\n<td>时机问题</td>\n<td>改时段再投 或 转自提</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门禁/楼栋进入受阻</td>\n<td>&quot;无法进入&quot;</td>\n<td>地址可达性问题</td>\n<td>转自提（再投无用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址不完整/错误</td>\n<td>&quot;地址不存在/不完整&quot;</td>\n<td>数据问题</td>\n<td>改址（详见第 2 篇）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒收</td>\n<td>&quot;收件人拒收&quot;</td>\n<td>意图问题</td>\n<td>立即退回，不再尝试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址为商业地址但在非工作时间派送</td>\n<td>&quot;公司已关闭&quot;</td>\n<td>时机问题</td>\n<td>按商业地址时段再投</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天气/突发不可抗力</td>\n<td>&quot;不可抗力&quot;</td>\n<td>网络问题</td>\n<td>顺延，不消耗再投次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无人在家但可安全放置</td>\n<td>投递员判断</td>\n<td>政策问题</td>\n<td>授权留放（可从一开始避免）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表里最关键的一列是&quot;本质问题&quot;。<strong>可达性问题和数据问题不能用&quot;再投&quot;解决</strong>——再投一次会遇到完全相同的障碍，只是多花一天和一笔再投费。只有&quot;时机问题&quot;和&quot;政策问题&quot;才是再投能改善的。系统必须在失败原因回传后先做这个分类，再决定动作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[派送失败事件] --&gt; B{失败原因分类}&#10;  B --&gt;|时机问题| C[改时段再投]&#10;  B --&gt;|可达性问题| D[转自提点/柜机]&#10;  B --&gt;|数据问题| E[改址流程]&#10;  B --&gt;|意图问题| F[立即退回]&#10;  B --&gt;|不可抗力| G[顺延不计次]&#10;  C --&gt; H{再投成本 &lt; 退回成本?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[执行再投]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| D&#10;  D --&gt; J[通知买家新取件方式]&#10;  E --&gt; K[退回前干预窗口]\">graph TD\n  A[派送失败事件] --&gt; B{失败原因分类}\n  B --&gt;|时机问题| C[改时段再投]\n  B --&gt;|可达性问题| D[转自提点/柜机]\n  B --&gt;|数据问题| E[改址流程]\n  B --&gt;|意图问题| F[立即退回]\n  B --&gt;|不可抗力| G[顺延不计次]\n  C --&gt; H{再投成本 &lt; 退回成本?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[执行再投]\n  H --&gt;|否| D\n  D --&gt; J[通知买家新取件方式]\n  E --&gt; K[退回前干预窗口]</pre><h2 id=\"再投的代价模型\">再投的代价模型</h2><p>再投不是免费的。它的成本由四项构成，且这四项在不同承运商、不同国家差异很大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四项成本的构成\">四项成本的构成</h3><p><strong>直接再投费</strong>：多数商业快递对每次再投收取固定费用（常见 1–5 欧元/美元），邮政体系通常免费或收取极低的手续费。这一项是显性的，容易计入。</p>\n<p><strong>时效损失</strong>：再投意味着至少一天的额外在途时间。如果原始承诺是&quot;5 天送达&quot;，再投一次可能直接违约，触发平台侧的时效罚款或买家投诉。</p>\n<p><strong>累积失败概率</strong>：这是最容易被忽略的一项。如果单次派送成功率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，那么第二次尝试的成功率通常<strong>低于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>——因为第一次失败的原因（买家白天不在家）往往在第二次依然存在。假设再投成功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2 = 0.6p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则连续两次失败的概率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - p - (1-p) \\cdot 0.6p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，这个数字在小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 时会显著上升。</p>\n<p><strong>二次失败后的退货成本</strong>：如果最终仍然失败并退回，成本包含返程运费、退货处理、退款、以及最关键的<strong>差评与复购损失</strong>。</p>\n<p>把这四项合并，一次再投的<strong>期望成本</strong>可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>retry</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>fee</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>delay</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>cs</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>reputation</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{retry}} = c_{\\text{fee}} + c_{\\text{delay}} + (1 - p_2)\\left(c_{\\text{return}} + c_{\\text{cs}} + c_{\\text{reputation}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fee</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">delay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reputation</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>reputation</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{reputation}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reputation</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是差评与复购损失的货币化估计。这个式子给出了一个明确的决策标准：<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>retry</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{retry}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">retry</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过&quot;直接转自提&quot;或&quot;直接退回&quot;的成本时，再投不是理性选择。</strong> 在低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的场景下（例如门禁受阻的公寓），这个条件很容易被触发。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function expectedRetryCost(ctx) {&#10;  const { retryFee, delayCost, pSecondAttempt, returnCost, csCost, reputationCost } = ctx;&#10;  return retryFee + delayCost + (1 - pSecondAttempt) * (returnCost + csCost + reputationCost);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function decideAction(reasonClass, ctx) {&#10;  const retry = expectedRetryCost(ctx);&#10;  if (reasonClass === &#39;accessibility&#39;) {&#10;    return { action: &#39;redirect_pickup&#39;, reason: &#39;retry cannot fix access barrier&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  if (reasonClass === &#39;data&#39;) return { action: &#39;address_correction&#39; };&#10;  if (reasonClass === &#39;intent&#39;) return { action: &#39;return_immediately&#39;, reason: &#39;buyer refused&#39; };&#10;  if (retry &gt; ctx.redirectPickupCost) return { action: &#39;redirect_pickup&#39;, reason: &#39;retry not economical&#39; };&#10;  return { action: &#39;retry&#39;, expectedCost: retry };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expectedRetryCost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">retryFee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delayCost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pSecondAttempt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">returnCost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">csCost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reputationCost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retryFee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delayCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pSecondAttempt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (returnCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> csCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reputationCost);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> decideAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reasonClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> retry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expectedRetryCost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (reasonClass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'accessibility'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'redirect_pickup'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retry cannot fix access barrier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (reasonClass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'data'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'address_correction'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (reasonClass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'intent'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'return_immediately'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'buyer refused'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (retry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.redirectPickupCost) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'redirect_pickup'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retry not economical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retry'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, expectedCost: retry };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"再投次数需要上限\">再投次数需要上限</h3><p>即使单次再投是理性的，也必须有次数上限。实践的共识是最多再投 1–2 次，之后无论原因都转自提或退回。原因有二：一是累积失败概率会快速上升（第三次尝试的成功率已很低）；二是买家体验会随每次&quot;又没送到&quot;而恶化，与其反复打扰不如干脆给一个确定的解决方案。上限值应作为策略参数固化在承运商配置里，不能靠投递员自行判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转自提-比再投更优的默认选项\">转自提：比再投更优的默认选项</h2><p>在多数失败场景下，&quot;转自提&quot;（把包裹改投到附近的自提点或柜机）比&quot;再投&quot;更优，理由有三。</p>\n<h3 id=\"转自提的三重优势\">转自提的三重优势</h3><p><strong>它消除了失败的根本原因</strong>。再投失败的原因是&quot;买家不在场&quot;，而自提点永远&quot;在&quot;——买家可以自行选择时间去取。这从定义上把成功率提到接近 100%。</p>\n<p><strong>它的成本结构更优</strong>。转自提通常只需支付承运商的一次改投费（往往与再投费相当或更低），且不产生第二次派送。更重要的是它避免了&quot;二次失败→退回&quot;这条最贵的路径。</p>\n<p><strong>它给出了确定的答案</strong>。买家收到的是&quot;包裹在 X 点，请在 Y 天内取走&quot;这样一条可执行的指令，而不是&quot;明天再送一次&quot;这样又一个不确定的承诺。可预期性本身就有价值。</p>\n<p>前提是自提网络覆盖到位——这正是<a href=\"../pickup-locker-multi/pudo-locker-network\">自提点/PUDO/快递柜网络</a>讨论的内容。如果最近的可用自提点在 2 公里外，转自提对买家的负担可能超过其收益，此时需按距离阈值判断。同时要注意保管期与通知，包裹转自提后进入<a href=\"../pickup-locker-multi/pickup-notification-hold\">到柜通知与保管规则</a>的流程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;failedDeliveryAction&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;trackingNo&quot;: &quot;LX123456789DE&quot;,&#10;    &quot;failureEvent&quot;: { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;recipient_absent&quot;, &quot;reasonClass&quot;: &quot;timing&quot;, &quot;attemptNo&quot;: 1 },&#10;    &quot;decision&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;redirect_pickup&quot;,&#10;      &quot;chosenPoint&quot;: { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;DE-BER-10431&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;locker&quot;, &quot;distanceM&quot;: 420 },&#10;      &quot;rejectedAlternative&quot;: { &quot;action&quot;: &quot;retry&quot;, &quot;expectedCost&quot;: 8.4, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;p2 too low&quot; },&#10;      &quot;notifyBuyer&quot;: { &quot;channels&quot;: [&quot;sms&quot;, &quot;push&quot;], &quot;holdUntil&quot;: &quot;2026-10-06T23:59:59Z&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span 