#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE-BER-10431\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"locker\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"distanceM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">420</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rejectedAlternative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"retry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"expectedCost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p2 too low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"notifyBuyer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"push\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"holdUntil\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-06T23:59:59Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"授权留放-从源头减少失败\">授权留放：从源头减少失败</h2><p>最经济的失败处理是不让失败发生。对于&quot;无人在家但可安全放置&quot;的场景，可以在订单阶段获取买家的<strong>留放授权</strong>（leave-if-no-response），使投递员在无人应答时直接放置包裹，而不是带回。</p>\n<h3 id=\"授权与保价互斥\">授权与保价互斥</h3><p>授权留放的关键是风险归属必须清晰。买家授权之后，包裹丢失的风险由买家承担；未授权时由卖家或承运商承担。因此授权必须是<strong>明示的、可撤回的、按订单或按地址生效的</strong>，不能默认勾选。部分邮政体系对此有明确规定：美国邮政的规则是，只有在包裹带有 &quot;CARRIER—LEAVE IF NO RESPONSE&quot; 背书、且未保价、且不需要签名时，才可以在无人应答时留在未受保护的位置（<a href=\"https://pe.usps.com/text/dmm300/508.htm\">USPS DMM 508</a>）。</p>\n<p>这条规则的启示是：留放授权与保价、签名要求是互斥的。高价值商品不应提供留放选项，因为一旦丢失，争议处理的举证责任会落到卖家身上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>再投策略的第一步是<strong>失败原因分类</strong>：只有&quot;时机问题&quot;和&quot;政策问题&quot;能靠再投改善；可达性问题、数据问题、意图问题需要不同处理。</li>\n<li>再投的期望成本 = 再投费 + 时效损失 + (1 − 二次成功率) × (退货成本 + 客服成本 + 声誉损失)；二次成功率通常低于首次，累积失败概率上升很快。</li>\n<li>再投次数必须有上限（通常 1–2 次），之后强制转自提或退回，上限应固化在策略配置中。</li>\n<li>转自提在多数失败场景下优于再投：它从定义上消除失败原因、成本结构更优、且给买家确定的指令；前提是自提网络覆盖在可接受距离内。</li>\n<li>授权留放从源头减少失败，但必须是明示、可撤回、按订单生效的，且与保价/签名要求互斥，高价值商品不应提供。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸：数据类失败导致的改址流程见<a href=\"address-correction-reroute\">改址/重派与退回前干预</a>；最终失败后的举证责任见<a href=\"proof-of-delivery-dispute\">签收证明与妥投争议</a>；再投费作为成本项进入选路模型见<a href=\"../lastmile-carrier-network/remote-area-surcharge\">偏远地区识别与附加费</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"派送失败再投策略","id":"派送失败再投策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：失败原因的分类学","id":"核心概念-失败原因的分类学"},{"level":3,"text":"失败原因分类表","id":"失败原因分类表"},{"level":2,"text":"再投的代价模型","id":"再投的代价模型"},{"level":3,"text":"四项成本的构成","id":"四项成本的构成"},{"level":3,"text":"再投次数需要上限","id":"再投次数需要上限"},{"level":2,"text":"转自提：比再投更优的默认选项","id":"转自提-比再投更优的默认选项"},{"level":3,"text":"转自提的三重优势","id":"转自提的三重优势"},{"level":2,"text":"授权留放：从源头减少失败","id":"授权留放-从源头减少失败"},{"level":3,"text":"授权与保价互斥","id":"授权与保价互斥"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"邮政/快递选择与体验差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-lastmile-delivery-network/pickup-locker-multi/postal-vs-courier-choice"},"next":{"title":"改址/重派与退回前干预","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-lastmile-delivery-network/delivery-fail-retry/address-correction-reroute"}}